      <h2>What happens next.</h2>
      <p><strong>Within 4 business hours:</strong> Phone call or email. For simple jobs (EV charger swap, ceiling fan, outlet add) we quote from your description. For panel upgrades, rewires, or commercial work we schedule a 30-minute site visit.</p>
      <p><strong>Site visit (when needed):</strong> Ray or Vivian walks the job. We photograph the existing conditions and leave with enough information to produce a fixed-price quote. No sales pressure at the visit, we're scoping, not selling.</p>
      <p><strong>Quote:</strong> Emailed within 2 business days of the site visit. Line-item scope, permit fees, equipment model numbers, timeline. Valid 30 days.</p>
      <p><strong>Scheduled install:</strong> Most residential jobs 5–10 business days out. Rush work available for an additional fee when we have the capacity.</p>

      <h3>If your power is out.</h3>
      <p>Hang up from this site and call <a href="tel:9283159094">(928) 315-9094</a>, press 9 at the menu. On-call tech responds inside 90 minutes during business hours, 2 hours after-hours.</p>
    </div>
